Z||000000||V8Fiero||03-17-2001||07:28 PM||||Man its been so nice here lately. Hit 50 today. I finally had a chance to work on the V8 thats been sitting dormant in my driveway since last summer.<P>Couple things left to do and it will be on the road again.<P>1) Hook up the new four core radiator.<BR>2) Hook up the tranny cooler.<BR>3) Have the drivers side axle shortened. (Yes I said shortened...Dont ask me what happened, but I had to have the pass. side lengthened also....)<BR>4) Finish the upgrade of the GT fascias.<P>Well thats about all I need to get the car on the road. Have ordered a few parts and hopefully by next weekend it will be a go.<BR>Thanks for letting me share my excitement with you guys and gals.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Scott||||reg||14
