Z||000002||V8Fiero||03-17-2001||09:10 PM||||Well its a corvette radiator and doesnt have the cooler for the tranny, thus I have to put on a cooler. Not sure what yr the radiator is for but the dimensions are identical to the fiero radiator. I might be able to just drop it in using the original brackets. I have to have the inlet/outlets moved on the radiator to the right spots also. Best part of the whole radiator deal is that I got it off of ebay for $60. WAY better than the $350 that archie wants.<P><BR>Scott||||reg||1
